<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/fn/AMA18-Footnote3.8> a ipbes:Footnote ;
    ipbes:Report ipbes:AMA18 ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "After the Summary for Policy Makers (SPM) for the Americas assessment was completed in early December 2017, in a paper published in Science on 14 December 2017, Ulloa Ulloa et al. (2017) reported 124,993 species of vascular plants (seed plants, ferns and fern allies) for the Americas region found in 6227 genera and 355 plant families. The number of species reported corresponds to 33% of the world total." ;
    dcterms:identifier "Footnote3.8" .

