<http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ref/2333011/items/98WEUBJS> a ipbes:Reference ;
    ipbes:Chapter <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/AMA18ch1>,
        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/ch/AMA18ch2> ;
