        <http://ontology.ipbes.net/report/bgm/AMA18-21> ;
    ipbes:Report ipbes:AMA18 ;
    ipbes:hasDescription "Examples include the increase of Caribbean forest cover and many restored areas in all subregions and units of analysis." ;
    dcterms:identifier "B3" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Biodiversity has increased in some areas through effective management or natural processes in abandoned agricultural areas." .

